# 600s ground-state-init time averages (targets):
#   🔥 fire   ~37%  (25–50%)  hearth cycle, competes with cold pump
#   ❄ ice    ~63%  (50–75%)  cold is natural attractor
#   👥 people ~45%  (25–55%)  labor; drained by people→bread Lindblad
#   🍞 bread  ~55%  (45–75%)  sustained by fire and gold
#   ⚙ gears  ~47%  (35–65%)  two-rhythm beat with wind
#   💨 wind   ~53%  (40–65%)  second driven rhythm
#   💰 gold   ~42%  (25–65%)  near critical: market is noisy and sensitive
#   🧺 basket ~58%  (35–75%)  near critical: anti-correlated with gold
#
# Beating: fire 0.0667 Hz + wind 0.050 Hz → beat period ~60s sim (120s wall)
# Self-energy detunings:
#   Q1 people/bread: Δ=0.15  Q2 gears/wind: Δ=0.10  Q3 gold/basket: Δ=0.08
#
# Lindblad (in biomes.json icon_components):
#   👥 decay→🍞 rate=0.015  (workers exhaust; creates bread demand)
#   🔥 lindblad_outgoing→❄ rate=0.008  (cold pump; fire cools naturally)
#
# Production chain:
#   FIRE: fire -> bread (direct baking)
#   LABOR: bread -> people (via Rabi); people -> gears
#   WIND: wind (driven) -> gears (via Rabi)
#   COMMERCE: gears -> gold -> bread (buys food), gold <-> basket
#   WINTER: ice -> baskets (harvest), baskets -> people (stored food)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

